# Phase 0–3 does not load .env files. Gemini keys belong in the API & Cost dialog.
# The dialog saves secrets only in Windows Credential Manager through keyring.
# Optional environment variables (set these in PowerShell before starting):
# FFMPEG_PATH=C:\Tools\ffmpeg\bin\ffmpeg.exe
# FFPROBE_PATH=C:\Tools\ffmpeg\bin\ffprobe.exe
# VKDUB_DATA_DIR=C:\VKDubData
# Model downloads need the internet; transcription uses installed models offline.
# Never put API keys in project files, source code, or logs.
